  "releaseNotes": "Streaming error reporting: a streamable select that unions two striding paths and then takes a step (e.g. (/A | /B)/PRICE) now reports the XTSE3430 streamability error instead of silently producing no output, and an unknown collation supplied to fn:distinct-values/max/min/index-of via an input-navigating argument now raises FOCH0002 under streaming as it does without streaming. Requires PhoenixmlDb.Core 1.1.9 and PhoenixmlDb.XQuery 1.4.6. See RELEASES.md for full notes.",
